# Cargo.lock IS committed on purpose: this is a binary, and a pinned
# dependency set is what makes cargo build --locked reproducible.

# Never commit real machine backups - they contain this machine's GUIDs,
# registry values and GPU limits. Keep the folder, not its contents.
/XMG-Backup/
**/XMG-Backup/

